PredictiveMaintain.SubscriptionBillingAPI.PostgresBillingRepository --> PredictiveMaintain.BillingDatabase <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "Lee y escribe\n<size:16>[SQL]</size>"

